==English==
===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|statistics|lang=en}} Any of the three [[point]]s that divide an [[ordered]] [[distribution]] into four parts, each containing a [[quarter]] of the [[population]].
# {{context|statistics|lang=en}} Any one of the four groups so divided.
#:''This school is ranked in the first '''quartile'''.''

